# title: Athena (express) autocall
# category: Structured notes
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: Redeemed at the first anniversary the stock is at or above its initial level, with 8% per year elapsed; capital at risk below 60% after three years.
#
# Notional 1000. Snowball coupon: 8% x number of years at redemption.

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot()
    alive = 1

2028-01-04
    if spot() >= s0 then
        pays 1000 * 1.08
        alive = 0
    endIf

2029-01-04
    if alive = 1 and spot() >= s0 then
        pays 1000 * 1.16
        alive = 0
    endIf

2030-01-04
    if alive = 1 then
        if spot() >= s0 then
            pays 1000 * 1.24
        else
            if spot() < 0.60 * s0 then pays 1000 * spot() / s0 else pays 1000 endIf
        endIf
    endIf
